WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.850
Your bitcoin is only as safe as your keys.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.912
And most keys live on devices that are online.

3
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.450
Online devices can be hacked.

4
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.970
And hardware wallets cost money, and ship to your home address.

5
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:17.850
SafeKeepVault keeps your bitcoin keys offline, using a computer you already own.

6
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.758
It's free, and open source.

7
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:21.550
Here's how it works.

8
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:23.650
Put it on a USB flash drive.

9
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.550
Start your computer from it, with no internet at all.

10
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:28.675
Then approve your payments, offline.

11
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:33.593
Everything happens on a full-size screen that never goes online.

12
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:38.088
So you see exactly who gets paid, and how much, before you sign.

13
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:41.850
Your wallet app stays online. Your keys never do.

14
00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:46.715
Payments cross over by QR code or USB drive, and come back signed.

15
00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:50.050
It costs nothing.

16
00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.550
There's nothing to order.

17
00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.350
Your backups are done properly.

18
00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.429
And every line of code is public.

19
00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:00.819
SafeKeepVault. Get it free, at safekeepbitcoin.com.

